{
	"note": "Maps each Afterglow icon id to the ReactOS icon it replaces. status is named when the sheet or the plan names a ReactOS object and unmapped otherwise. resource is the module and icon group id to replace; it is null unless the id is verified, and evidence says how: source (ReactOS 0.4.16 source) and binary (the installed 0.4.16 shell32.dll). Ids listed here come from the folder icon research; every null is unverified, not guessed.",
